OL,4,BRaya to miss Dortmund game but injury  
OL,5,B'not serious'                          
OL,6,GArsenal goalkeeper David Raya's        
OL,7,Gshoulder injury "doesn't look too      
OL,8,Gserious", but he will miss Tuesday's   
OL,9,GChampions League against Borussia      
OL,10,GDortmund, says Mikel Arteta.           
OL,12,FRaya was helped off the pitch in the   
OL,13,F70th minute of Arsenal's 2-2 draw at   
OL,14,FNewcastle on Saturday.                 
OL,16,FHe hurt his left shoulder while        
OL,17,Fclaiming a cross and making contact    
OL,18,Fwith Newcastle forward William Osula.  
